{"c":[{"id":"205b1d0a36b8a24e","sum":"Shared-Mac input: synthetic HID keys go to LaunchServices' front app (guard on lsappinfo front); caret-screen write/press act only in --act-pids (subset of --only-pids), and rechecks fail closed on unreadable role/value/label.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T113723Z-250b757576dc3838","text":"Synthetic HID keys go to LaunchServices' front app, not the owner of the frontmost window; guard on lsappinfo front before typing into a fixture.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T114801Z-32531afb7e4fe1e0","text":"caret-screen write/press verbs act only in --act-pids, which must be a subset of --only-pids; without it the reader only reads. Rechecks fail closed on unreadable role/subrole/value/label.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"55197345bf228f3c","sum":"Fill recency uses the window left just before the form's last focus, not the latest focus (else Jev answers none). caret-fixture spawned from the frontmost app took the foreground; it now deactivates on activation; poll lsappinfo front in GUI runs.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T114801Z-431742a743596ba6","text":"Fill recency: take the just-left window from focus history (the window before the form's last focus), not the latest focus; latest-focus made Jev answer none on most fields once the user moved to another form.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T130715Z-7922f91e68f9ff52","text":"caret-fixture spawned from the frontmost app (T3 or a terminal) became the active app and held the foreground for a whole run; it now deactivates on becoming active. Poll lsappinfo front during GUI runs.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
